Hi,

Adeos candidate patch r2c1 for x86 is available from our download area
on savannah
(http://freesoftware.fsf.org/download/adeos/snapshots/adeos-20020626.tar.gz)
and from the public CVS tree (tag "snap-20020626").

This pre-release improves the Adeos/x86 layer in terms of stability,
performances and functionalities. SMP is now supported and has (only)
been validated on a Dual PIII. If you can & wish to experiment this
further, please go ahead and report results. Any help is greatly
appreciated (as usual).

PS: the initial Adeos API documentation is underway.

Best regards,

Philippe.

